    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85417" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-τέλεια</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολυ-είη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>great expense,
				extravagance,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐτέλεια,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.87
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				6.12
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρυφὴ καὶ π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.6.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τῶν βίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					13.1.1
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				9.10.5
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>costliness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσθῆτος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Lac.</u>
					7.3
				</span></i>
			, etc.</div>
